  "draft_py": "# Cryptic Caves. Kept: \"{T}: Add {C}.\" (compiler, abilities[0]).\n# 2. \"{1}, {T}, Sacrifice this land: Draw a card.\" -- Silversmote Ghoul's B5c-cost-b-sacrifice-draw\n#    with Fabled Passage's {T} and a generic {1}.\n# 3. \"Activate only if you control five or more lands.\" -- the activation gate rides on the ability's\n#    condition, as Celestial Enforcer's B5a-activate-only-flying, CONTROLLER_COUNT_GE 5 over lands.\ndraw = ActivatedAbility(\n    cost=Cost(parts=(\n        CostManaGeneric(amount=QConst(value=1)),\n        CostSacrifice(target=Selector(\n            count=QConst(value=1),\n            mode=SelectorMode.CHOOSE,\n            filter=FAnd(children=(\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE),\n            )),\n            zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n        )),\n        CostTap(),\n    )),\n    effect=A(Verb.DRAW, {'amount': QConst(value=1), 'controller': ControllerRef.YOU}),\n    condition=FAtom(\n        pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_COUNT_GE,\n        count=QConst(value=5),\n        inner_filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Land'),\n    ),\n)\nabilities = [*compiled, draw]\n",
